G`, `LSM6DSO_ACC_TAG`, `LSM6DSO_ACC_TAG + 1`, and `0x1f`).\n* **CL Size \u0026 Scope:** ✅ Size: XS (+5, -0). Focused on a single logical fix.\n* **Commit Message:** ❌ `TEST\u003d./twister -T zephyr/test/drivers -s drivers.default` does not compile `driver/accelgyro_lsm6dso.c`, and the body narrates diff expressions (`ARRAY_SIZE(ag_maps)`, `ag_maps[tag]`, `samples_to_discard[id]`). See the inline comment on `/COMMIT_MSG` for a suggested replacement.\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/266e2cea-a6fa-4b22-8dad-f331f965864b)",
